            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "で、私は礼を言った。\nはははっ、ボディランゲージってやつさ。",
            "enText": "And, I replied with my thanks. <i>Hahaha,</i> \nit's the power of body language.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 84,
            "voiceIdx": 74,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "な、なるほど……？",
